{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1766","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Hamiltonian Wall"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sir Monocarp Hamilton is planning to paint his wall. The wall can be represented as a grid, consisting of $$$2$$$ rows and $$$m$$$ columns. Initially, the wall is completely white."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Monocarp wants to paint a black picture on the wall. In particular, he wants cell $$$(i, j)$$$ (the $$$j$$$-th cell in the $$$i$$$-th row) to be colored black, if $$$c_{i, j} =$$$ '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', and to be left white, if $$$c_{i, j} =$$$ '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"W"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'. Additionally, he wants each column to have at least one black cell, so, for each $$$j$$$, the following constraint is satisfied: $$$c_{1, j}$$$, $$$c_{2, j}$$$ or both of them will be equal to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In order for the picture to turn out smooth, Monocarp wants to place down a paint brush in some cell $$$(x_1, y_1)$$$ and move it along the path $$$(x_1, y_1), (x_2, y_2), \\dots, (x_k, y_k)$$$ so that: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for each $$$i$$$, $$$(x_i, y_i)$$$ and $$$(x_{i+1}, y_{i+1})$$$ share a common side; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" all black cells appear in the path "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly once"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" white cells don't appear in the path. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Determine if Monocarp can paint the wall."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of testcases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each testcase contains a single integer $$$m$$$ ($$$1 \\le m \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of columns in the wall."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the next two lines contains a string $$$c_i$$$, consisting of $$$m$$$ characters, where each character is either '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' or '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"W"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'. $$$c_{i, j}$$$ is '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', if the cell $$$(i, j)$$$ should be colored black, and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"W"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', if the cell $$$(i, j)$$$ should be left white."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additionally, for each $$$j$$$, the following constraint is satisfied: $$$c_{1, j}$$$, $$$c_{2, j}$$$ or both of them are equal to '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The sum of $$$m$$$ over all testcases doesn't exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each testcase, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if Monocarp can paint a wall. Otherwise, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n3\nWBB\nBBW\n1\nB\nB\n5\nBWBWB\nBBBBB\n2\nBW\nWB\n5\nBBBBW\nBWBBB\n6\nBWBBWB\nBBBBBB\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nYES\nNO\nNO\nNO\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first testcase, Monocarp can follow a path $$$(2, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 2)$$$, $$$(1, 2)$$$, $$$(1, 3)$$$ with his brush. All black cells appear in the path exactly once, no white cells appear in the path."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second testcase, Monocarp can follow a path $$$(1, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 1)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third testcase: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the path $$$(1, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 2)$$$, $$$(2, 3)$$$, $$$(1, 3)$$$, $$$(2, 4)$$$, $$$(2, 5)$$$, $$$(1, 5)$$$ doesn't suffice because a pair of cells $$$(1, 3)$$$ and $$$(2, 4)$$$ doesn't share a common side; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the path $$$(1, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 2)$$$, $$$(2, 3)$$$, $$$(1, 3)$$$, $$$(2, 3)$$$, $$$(2, 4)$$$, $$$(2, 5)$$$, $$$(1, 5)$$$ doesn't suffice because cell $$$(2, 3)$$$ is visited twice; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the path $$$(1, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 2)$$$, $$$(2, 3)$$$, $$$(2, 4)$$$, $$$(2, 5)$$$, $$$(1, 5)$$$ doesn't suffice because a black cell $$$(1, 3)$$$ doesn't appear in the path; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" the path $$$(1, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 1)$$$, $$$(2, 2)$$$, $$$(2, 3)$$$, $$$(2, 4)$$$, $$$(2, 5)$$$, $$$(1, 5)$$$, $$$(1, 4)$$$, $$$(1, 3)$$$ doesn't suffice because a white cell $$$(1, 4)$$$ appears in the path. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1766C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1766/problem/C"}